msgid "Manual"
msgstr "Handbuch"

#: includes/class-user-guide.php:311
msgid ""
"User Manual and Technical Manual for TaxoCommerce Logistics, available "
"within this plugin."
msgstr "Benutzerhandbuch und technisches Handbuch für TaxoCommerce Logistics, in diesem Plugin verfügbar."

